# scenario: downgrade-blocked
# doc: downgrade-blocked.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude downgrade-blocked.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: the start shell is not approved (no --yolo, no whitelist, no terminal), so the shell audit denies it during preflight
# given: blocked raises an explicit error
# given: the provider never launches
event initialize
event blocked
err composition.shell_approval
event failure
err uncoded: blocked downgraded
event finalize
err uncoded: blocked downgraded
exit 1
